# Everything the build does not need, and several things it must not have.
#
# The security half matters as much as the speed half: without `.env` here, a
# careless `COPY . .` would bake real secrets into an image layer, where they
# survive deletion and travel with every push of that tag.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.venv
**/.venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc

# Build output — rebuilt inside the image, and stale copies would be shipped.
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
out
**/out

# Secrets. `.env.example` is deliberately NOT excluded: it is documentation.
.env
**/.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
**/*.log
**/coverage
docs
MauritiusOS
